      "layer_index": 2,
      "category": "availability",
      "statement": "Everything runs on one EKS cluster across three availability zones in us-east-1.",
      "tradeoff": "Multi-AZ within a single region survives AZ failures but is vulnerable to a full regional outage; cross-region failover is absent.",
      "ddia_axis": "reliability",
      "provenance": {
